<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 02:46:05 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>F-15E 在怀特曼空军基地取代 A-10 标志着鹰舰队进行更大规模的重组</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/f-15es-replacing-a-10s-at-whiteman-afb-signals-bigger-realignment-of-eagle-fleet</link><description>&lt;p&gt;将“攻击鹰”转移到预备役的一项令人惊讶的计划可能预示着如何分配更大的 F-15EX 机队。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/f-15es-replacing-a-10s-at-whiteman-afb-signals-bigger-realignment-of-eagle-fleet"&gt;怀特曼空军基地的 F-15E 取代 A-10 后，标志着鹰舰队进行更大的调整，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 21:40:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/f-15es-replacing-a-10s-at-whiteman-afb-signals-bigger-realignment-of-eagle-fleet</guid></item><item><title>无人机袭击地中海埃及港口引发担忧伊朗冲突将扩大（更新）</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-strike-on-egyptian-port-on-mediterranean-stokes-concerns-iran-conflict-will-widen</link><description>&lt;p&gt;关于谁击中了远离冲突地区的天然气油轮的说法众说纷纭，但这似乎是为了传递一个信息。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-strike-on-egyptian-port-on-mediterranean-stokes-concerns-iran-conflict-will-widen"&gt;无人机袭击地中海埃及港口引发担忧伊朗冲突将扩大（更新）&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 20:36:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/drone-strike-on-egyptian-port-on-mediterranean-stokes-concerns-iran-conflict-will-widen</guid></item><item><title>日本F-2战斗机现身 翼下新型大型隐形巡航导弹</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/japanese-f-2-fighter-appears-with-new-large-stealth-cruise-missile-under-its-wings</link><description>&lt;p&gt;此前未曾见过的导弹可能是空射型 25 型导弹，它极大地扩大了 F-2 的防区外打击范围。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/japanese-f-2-fighter-appears-with-new-large-stealth-cruise-missile-under-its-wings"&gt;日本F-2战斗机机翼下新型大型隐形巡航导弹亮相后&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 19:38:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/japanese-f-2-fighter-appears-with-new-large-stealth-cruise-missile-under-its-wings</guid></item><item><title>日本正式加入战斧巡航导弹俱乐部</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/japan-has-officially-joined-the-tomahawk-cruise-missile-club</link><description>&lt;p&gt;日本从其一艘驱逐舰上发射了第一枚战斧导弹，开创了远程巡航导弹能力的新时代。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/japan-has-officially-joined-the-tomahawk-cruise-missile-club"&gt;日本已正式加入战斧巡航导弹俱乐部的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:45:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/japan-has-officially-joined-the-tomahawk-cruise-missile-club</guid></item><item><title>中国驱逐舰与美国无人机船的遭遇凸显了未来交战规则问题</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/chinese-destroyers-encounter-with-u-s-drone-boat-highlights-future-rules-of-engagement-issues</link><description>&lt;p&gt;随着小型无人水面舰艇的激增，它们潜在构成的威胁将会增加，交战规则也必须适应。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/chinese-destroyers-encounter-with-u-s-drone-boat-highlights-future-rules-of-engagement-issues"&gt;中国驱逐舰与美国无人机船的相遇凸显了未来交战规则问题的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:11:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/chinese-destroyers-encounter-with-u-s-drone-boat-highlights-future-rules-of-engagement-issues</guid></item><item><title>中国从小型驱逐舰发射YJ-20高超音速反舰导弹</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/china-fires-yj-20-hypersonic-anti-ship-missile-from-smaller-destroyer</link><description>&lt;p&gt;将 YJ-20 部署在 052D 型驱逐舰上，而不仅仅是巨型 055 型驱逐舰上，可以将能力分布到更多的舰体和可能更大的区域。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/china-fires-yj-20-hypersonic-anti-ship-missile-from-smaller-destroyer"&gt;中国从小型驱逐舰发射 YJ-20 高超音速反舰导弹的&lt;/a&gt;报道首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 20:41:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/china-fires-yj-20-hypersonic-anti-ship-missile-from-smaller-destroyer</guid></item><item><title>F-47 最初必须使用劣质发动机飞行吗？</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/will-the-f-47-have-to-fly-initially-with-inferior-engines</link><description>&lt;p&gt;下一代战斗机发动机和 F-47 的时间表似乎不同步，这可能会导致临时发动机的出现，这在历史上是有先例的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;文章&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/will-the-f-47-have-to-fly-initially-with-inferior-engines"&gt;《F-47 最初必须使用劣质发动机飞行吗？》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 19:57:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/will-the-f-47-have-to-fly-initially-with-inferior-engines</guid></item><item><title>特朗普发誓要对伊朗导弹袭击进行报复，美国和沙特联手打击伊拉克（更新）</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/trump-vows-revenge-for-iranian-missile-attack-u-s-and-saudis-join-forces-to-strike-iraq</link><description>&lt;p&gt;与此同时，胡塞武装正在考虑袭击曼德海峡，而一份新报告强调了美国拦截弹库存的困境。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/trump-vows-revenge-for-iranian-missile-attack-u-s-and-saudis-join-forces-to-strike-iraq"&gt;特朗普发誓要对伊朗导弹袭击进行报复，美国和沙特联手打击伊拉克（更新）&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 17:11:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/trump-vows-revenge-for-iranian-missile-attack-u-s-and-saudis-join-forces-to-strike-iraq</guid></item><item><title>据报道，新加坡对 GCAP 计划感兴趣，展望第六代战斗机的未来</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/singapore-reportedly-looking-toward-6th-gen-fighter-future-with-interest-in-gcap-program</link><description>&lt;p&gt;新加坡尚未接收第一架 F-35，但这个地理位置优越的城邦国家正在关注接下来的情况，这并不奇怪。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/singapore-reportedly-looking-toward-6th-gen-fighter-future-with-interest-in-gcap-program"&gt;据报道，新加坡对 GCAP 计划感兴趣，展望第六代战斗机的未来，&lt;/a&gt;该帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 16:41:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/singapore-reportedly-looking-toward-6th-gen-fighter-future-with-interest-in-gcap-program</guid></item><item><title>珍贵的俄亥俄级导弹潜艇乔治亚号即将退役（更新）</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/prized-ohio-class-guided-missile-submarine-uss-georgia-heading-into-retirement</link><description>&lt;p&gt;美国海军的俄亥俄级导弹潜艇需求量很大，但所有潜艇都将在未来三年内退役。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/prized-ohio-class-guided-missile-submarine-uss-georgia-heading-into-retirement"&gt;获奖的俄亥俄级导弹潜艇乔治亚号即将退役（更新）&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:02:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/prized-ohio-class-guided-missile-submarine-uss-georgia-heading-into-retirement</guid></item></channel></rss>